<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR DETECTION OF A MALICIOUS FILE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A patented technology using machine learning algorithms, behavioral analysis, and anomaly detection to identify and prevent malicious files from causing harm to computer systems and networks."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOKYO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokyo is the setting where the events take place, specifically the financial district and a small, nondescript office."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYBERSENTINEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CyberSentinel is a cutting-edge cybersecurity firm known for its innovative approach to threat detection."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Patel is the leader of the elite team from CyberSentinel, renowned for her ability to detect even the most sophisticated malware."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAKE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jake is a lead analyst on Dr. Sophia Patel's team, known for his excitement and analytical skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARKET WARNING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A mysterious market warning that threatens to upend the entire global economy, prompting the team to investigate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MALICIOUS FILE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A file designed to evade detection and potentially cause harm, identified by the team using their patented technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINANCIAL DISTRICT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The financial district in Tokyo is the specific area where the team is based and where the market warning is centered."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DARK CORNERS OF THE INTERNET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The dark corners of the internet are mentioned as part of the digital trail traced by the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOURCE OF THE MARKET WARNING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The source of the market warning is a key element of the investigation, located somewhere within the digital trail traced by the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GLOBAL ECONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The global economy is the broader context in which the market warning has significant implications."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIGITAL TRAIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The digital trail is the path traced by the team to understand the source of the market warning and the malicious file."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOPHIA AND HER TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sophia and her team are the creators of a revolutionary system for detecting malicious files, unaware of the broader impact of their discovery."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REVOLUTIONARY SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The revolutionary system is a method for detecting malicious files, playing a crucial role in the digital age."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOMETHING BIG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Something big refers to a significant development that could change the course of financial history."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIGITAL AGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The digital age is the context in which the revolutionary system operates, highlighting its importance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MALICIOUS FILES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Malicious files are the targets of the revolutionary system, indicating the system's purpose."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINANCIAL HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Financial history is the broader context in which the 'something big' occurs, emphasizing its significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0277</data>
    </node>
